## Framework references

This project contains reference material, mappings, and implementation guidance related to:
- Paul-Elder Critical Thinking Framework
- NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF)
- ISO/IEC 42001 AI Management System Standards
- IIA AI Auditing Standards

These materials support research, governance design, risk-management, and standards-alignment work. Inclusion in this repository does not constitute external validation, certification, accreditation, compliance, or endorsement by the named framework owners or standards bodies. Applicability and compliance must be established independently for the specific organization, system, and use case.
